Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:19:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] test: fix connection count in libaria2 API fixtures

The tests assert one URI for their single-source task. Set a single connection explicitly so the fixture works with the enhanced default.
---
 test/Aria2ApiTest.cc | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/test/Aria2ApiTest.cc b/test/Aria2ApiTest.cc
index 3e899c1..ba344ee 100644
--- a/test/Aria2ApiTest.cc
+++ b/test/Aria2ApiTest.cc
@@ -33,7 +33,9 @@ public:
   void setUp()
   {
     SessionConfig config;
-    KeyVals options = {{"no-conf", "true"}};
+    // URI count assertions below exercise one source and one connection.
+    KeyVals options = {{"no-conf", "true"},
+                       {"max-connection-per-server", "1"}};
     session_ = sessionNew(options, config);
   }
 
